include translations/29079_soccer

Bind Npc 29079

On greeting
    Say "I'm the [Arena Master] in charge of this soccer field. How may I be of service today?"
    Topic "[Enter a soccer game and select a team]" do
        Say "You've come to enter a soccer game. I will transfer you to any team you select. The team can be composed of players from any nation. Please keep in mind that once a team has 11 players, you cannot join that team."
        Topic "[Enter as blue team]" do
            Join blue soccer team
        Topic "[Enter as red team]" do
            Join red soccer team
        Goto close
    Topic "[Exchange soccer medal for soccer uniform]" goto event_101
    Topic "[Start the soccer game]" do
        Start soccer game
    Goto close

On event_101
    If player has > 9 of 900349000
        Say "You've brought 10 [Goal Pendants]. Would you like to exchange them for a [Soccer Uniform]? Please be aware that once you choose to trade for a soccer uniform, all [Goal Pendants] in your inventory will be collected."
        Topic "A Type" do
            If player is Karus
                Trade 10 of 900349000 for 1 of 900362641 for 1 days
                Say exchange_complete_i_hope
                Topic "Confirm" goto close
            Else
                Trade 10 of 900349000 for 1 of 900357640 for 1 days
                Say exchange_complete_i_hope
                Topic "Confirm" goto close
            Goto close
        Topic "B Type" do
            If player is Karus
                Trade 10 of 900349000 for 1 of 929001609 for 1 days
                Say exchange_complete_i_hope
                Topic "Confirm" goto close
            Else
                Trade 10 of 900349000 for 1 of 927001607 for 1 days
                Say exchange_complete_i_hope
                Topic "Confirm" goto close
            Goto close
        Topic "C Type" do
            If player is Karus
                Trade 10 of 900349000 for 1 of 933001634 for 1 days
                Say exchange_complete_i_hope
                Topic "Confirm" goto close
            Else
                Trade 10 of 900349000 for 1 of 928001608 for 1 days
                Say exchange_complete_i_hope
                Topic "Confirm" goto close
            Goto close
    Else
        Say "You need 10 [Goal Pendants]. Please confirm the number of medals in your inventory."
        Topic "Close" goto close
